📘 InnKeeper — Hotel Management System

A modular hotel management application built in Python using CustomTkinter and SQLite.

📌 Overview

InnKeeper is a fully modular hotel management system designed for small to medium hotels.
It combines multiple departments under one system:

Reception

Restaurant / Bar

Cleaning / Housekeeping

Finance

Management (Admin)

Each module has its own UI, its own responsibilities, and all departments communicate through the same SQLite database.

The system is built to be expandable, editable, and easy to customize for real hotel environments.

