🔑 Login System

Roles:

Username	Password	Role
reception	1234	Receptionist
waiter	1234	Bar & Restaurant
clean	1234	Cleaning
finance	1234	Finance
manager	1234	Manager / Admin

New users can also be created directly in the database.

📂 Modules & Features
🛎️ Reception Module

Used for guest check-in, check-out, and room assignment.

Features:

Displays all rooms: available, reserved, occupied

Assign guests to rooms

Auto-calculate room price

View customer info

Record reservations

Update room status

Synchronizes with:

Cleaning module (dirty → needs cleaning)

Finance module (room payments)

🍽️ Restaurant / Bar Module

Used by waiters and bar staff.

Features:

Table grid with live status (free, serving, reserved, maintenance)

Waiter selection + per-table assignment

Add menu items to an order

Search inside menu

Quantity changer (+ / – buttons)

Notes per table

Print & Free (release table)

Select payment method (Cash / Card)

Logs every bill into finance_logs table

Full sync with the Manager's Restaurant Editor

🧹 Cleaning Service / Housekeeping

Used by housekeeping staff.

Features:

Room list with status:
Clean • Needs Cleaning • Occupied

Cleaner assignment dropdown

Notes from Reception

Auto-sync with Reception when a guest checks out

Daily overview

Management statistics:

Rooms cleaned per staff

Pending rooms

Completed tasks

💰 Finance Dashboard

Used by accountants and finance staff.

Features:

View today’s revenue

View monthly totals

Pie chart: Paid vs Pending

Line chart: revenue per day

Income breakdown per department

Outstanding payments

Recent transactions

Export options (CSV)

All income comes from:

Reception bills

Restaurant payments

Pending payments report

🛠️ Manager Panel (Admin)

This is the most powerful part of the system.

The manager can:

1. Open all department UIs

Reception

Restaurant

Cleaning

Finance

2. Edit Restaurant Data

Add / edit / delete menu items

Add / edit / delete tables

Change table status & seats

Automatically update Waiter UI

3. Edit Rooms

(Planned in next extension)

Add rooms

Remove rooms

Edit typology, prices, status

Sync with Reception UI

4. Edit Staff & Users

(Planned)

Add new users

Change roles

Reset passwords

Disable accounts

5. System Settings

Change theme (Light / Dark / System)

Change hotel name

Prepare for future customization

🗄️ Database Structure
users

Stores login info and roles.

rooms

Stores hotel rooms.

cleaning_tasks

Each task assigned to cleaner.

menu_items

Restaurant menu.

restaurant_tables

Table information.

restaurant_orders / order_items

Order logs.

finance_logs

Every payment from restaurant and reception.

reservations / clients

Reception data.

🚀 How to Run the Project
1. Requirements

Install Python packages:

pip install customtkinter pillow matplotlib

2. Run the app

Navigate to the project folder:

cd hotel_app


Run:

python main.py

3. Login

Use any of the demo accounts:

manager / 1234

reception / 1234

waiter / 1234

clean / 1234

finance / 1234

🎯 Why This App Works for Real Hotels

Uses SQLite → portable, lightweight, no server required

Modular UI → each role only sees their tools

Manager has full privileges → edit menu, tables, staff

Real-time sync between modules

Built with an expandable architecture

Cross-platform (Windows, Linux, macOS)

